535
00:22:12,590 --> 00:22:14,590
<i>You've probably
got one somewhere.</i>

536
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:17,600
- Uh, well parried,
my radial-witted friend.

537
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:21,100
<i>- Now, there's another way
you can go,</i>

538
00:22:21,100 --> 00:22:22,110
<i>right through the woods here.</i>

539
00:22:22,100 --> 00:22:24,100
<i>It's a half a mile,</i>

540
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:26,110
<i>but you'll need a compass
