541
00:22:26,110 --> 00:22:27,610
<i>You should have
one of them, too.</i>

542
00:22:27,610 --> 00:22:29,110
- Oh, and you'll need
a conical hat

543
00:22:29,110 --> 00:22:31,620
with eye holes cut into it.

544
00:22:36,120 --> 00:22:38,120
<i>- Oh, uh, by the way,
you wouldn't know</i>

545
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:40,120
<i>where there's a men's room
