it didn't exist?

553
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:10,380
- Well, evidently.

554
00:23:10,380 --> 00:23:11,880
- Wow, that's weird.
Hey, hey, do you suppose

555
00:23:11,890 --> 00:23:13,890
