- Shoo, Mike.

558
00:23:17,890 --> 00:23:22,400
I hope I never see Mike again
for as long as I live.

559
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:24,900
- Oh, ho, so, you never
want to see Mike again

560
00:23:24,900 --> 00:23:27,400
for as long as you live.
( CHUCKLING )

561
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:29,910
Okay, mister, I'll fix it
