the Mike sprite they call me.

564
00:23:34,910 --> 00:23:35,910
- This is totally amazing.

565
00:23:36,410 --> 00:23:37,410
I had no idea.
- Quiet!

566
00:23:37,410 --> 00:23:38,420
This has nothing
to do with you.

567
00:23:38,910 --> 00:23:40,410
- Wow.

568
00:23:40,410 --> 00:23:41,410
- I heard your wish;

569
00:23:41,420 --> 00:23:43,420
and, well,
now you're gonna get it.

570
00:23:43,420 --> 00:23:45,920
No more Mike from now on.

571
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:48,430
- Wow, wow.

572
00:23:48,420 --> 00:23:49,920
- Look at that.
- Live and learn, huh?

573
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,420
There is a Mike sprite.

574
00:23:51,430 --> 00:23:52,930
- The name's Mikey.

575
00:23:52,930 --> 00:23:53,930
- Right,
yeah, fine.

576
00:23:55,430 --> 00:23:57,430
- You got your wish.

577
00:23:57,430 --> 00:23:59,440
- Uh-huh-- we, we, uh,
we understand that.

578
00:23:59,430 --> 00:24:00,430
- Yeah.

579
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:03,940
- No, um--
- No Mike.

580
00:24:03,940 --> 00:24:04,940
- Exactly.
- Right.

581
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:07,940
Ha, ha, this is great.

582
00:24:11,450 --> 00:24:12,450
- What's that you say?

583
00:24:12,950 --> 00:24:14,450
- Uh, I didn't say anything.

584
00:24:14,450 --> 00:24:15,450
- Neither did I.

585
00:24:17,950 --> 00:24:18,960
- Heh, heh.

586
00:24:18,950 --> 00:24:22,950
- You, you got
your wish.

587
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:24,960
- Yup.
- No.

588
00:24:25,960 --> 00:24:29,970
- Ah, okay, uh, gee,
I wish I could have

589
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:34,460
