Is that it?

600
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:51,480
- Well, yes.

601
00:24:51,490 --> 00:24:52,490
- Oh, all right.

602
00:24:52,490 --> 00:24:54,990
Uh, aw, gee, Mikey,

603
00:24:54,990 --> 00:24:56,490
I didn't realize
what I was missing.

604
00:24:56,490 --> 00:24:58,500
Isn't there anything
we can do?

605
00:24:58,490 --> 00:25:00,490
Please, let me
take back my wish.

606
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:03,500
- Well, okay, I'll do it
just this once.

607
00:25:03,500 --> 00:25:06,500
- Right, okay.
- But next time be more careful.

608
00:25:06,500 --> 00:25:07,500
- We will, we will.
- Yeah, right.

609
00:25:07,500 --> 00:25:10,010
- Don't ever make
that wish again!

610
00:25:11,010 --> 00:25:12,010
- Whoa--ho.
- Ah.

611
00:25:12,010 --> 00:25:13,010
- Wow.

612
00:25:13,010 --> 00:25:15,010
- Well, so there must be
a sprite for everything.

613
00:25:15,010 --> 00:25:16,010
Now, what if I said,

614
00:25:16,010 --> 00:25:20,020
