Mike's socks again"?

615
00:25:20,010 --> 00:25:21,010
- Aw, no.

616
00:25:21,020 --> 00:25:23,020
- The name's Mike's socksy.

617
00:25:23,020 --> 00:25:25,020
The Mike's socks sprite
they call me.

618
00:25:25,020 --> 00:25:26,520
- Right--
uh, we'll be right back.

619
00:25:26,520 --> 00:25:28,020
Hey, come on,
I want my socks back.

620
00:25:28,020 --> 00:25:29,530
- No Mike's socks.

621
00:25:29,520 --> 00:25:31,020
- Geez.
- Okay, well.

622
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:32,030
