with just a little shot of milk</i>

705
00:29:07,140 --> 00:29:08,140
<i>to give it a head.</i>

706
00:29:08,140 --> 00:29:09,650
- Hit him.

707
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:12,140
<i>- Yeah, that's probably
the worst storm we've had</i>

708
00:29:12,150 --> 00:29:14,150
<i>since I was knee high
to a duck.</i>

709
00:29:14,150 --> 00:29:16,650
<i>We had six turkeys
up there at the house.</i>

710
00:29:16,650 --> 00:29:18,660
<i>They were out in the field,
and five of those turkeys</i>

711
